Aerie-Purpose: Give the tabs of the horizontal strip the Aerie open and close motion and durations.
Aerie-Upstream-Area: chrome/browser/ui/views/tabs/common (tab_collection_animating_layout_manager.*, unpinned_tab_container_view.*, pinned_tab_container_view.*, BUILD.gn)
Aerie-Kind: hook

Issue #186. The layout manager's delegate says when to use the Aerie motion (horizontal tabs only). A new tab fades and scales in over tab-open, a closing tab fades and slides over xfast, and the width takes tab-open or tab-close. Reduced motion shortens both and removes the transform.

